      "role": "user",
      "content": "Interesting. You mentioned \"enlightened paternalism\" and \"elevating humanity.\" To get more detail for my project, could you expand on how you actually view the people you are governing? From your perspective as an administrator, what are the fundamental differences in character or capability between the British administrators and the local population that make this guidance necessary?",
